# AI assistant files
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
*.claude

# Local TLS material (dev/test PKI - never commit private keys). The
# default location moved outside the repository (#598: make certs and the
# server both default to SEP2_CERT_DIR, or ~/tls); this entry is a
# defense-in-depth net for a manual override that still targets a
# repo-relative certs/ directory at the repository root. Anchored so it
# cannot also match internal/certs/, a source package.
/certs/

# CSIP conformance fixtures. The SunSpec V1.2 test PKI is gitignored
# per workspace policy and provisioned out of band (see
# test/csip/README.md). Topology YAMLs (#52) ARE checked in.
test/csip/fixtures/*
!test/csip/fixtures/.gitkeep
!test/csip/fixtures/*.yaml

